* leung_nmcnr_pin_3 -- AnalogGym topology on TSMC16 BSIM-CMG (LEVEL=72)
* Connectivity and mirror ratios are the shipped ones; geometry is re-designed for 0.8 V FinFET.
.subckt leung_nmcnr_pin_3 gnda vdda vinn vinp vout
Nm11 VOUT net013 VDDA VDDA psvt_l90_f6 m=10   $ BIASCM_PMOS
Nm7 net049 net013 VDDA VDDA psvt_l90_f6 m=1   $ BIASCM_PMOS
